# Ozel anahtarlar asla depoya girmez (karar 0050). Apple Sign in with Apple
# .p8, PEM, PKCS#12/Java anahtar deposu, SSH anahtari. Denetim:
# `pnpm check:secrets` (scripts/check-private-keys.mjs, CI'da da kosar).
*.p8
AuthKey_*
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
id_rsa
id_rsa.*
id_dsa
id_ecdsa
id_ed25519
id_ed25519.*
